OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy today with the
OL,6,Fbest of the sunny spells towards the
OL,7,Feast of the country. Remaining dry
OL,8,Facross the south, but a few showers
OL,9,Fwill develop elsewhere, especially
OL,10,Flater on. Feeling noticeably cooler as
OL,11,Fa brisk westerly wind develops.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA few showers continuing
OL,14,Fovernight, especially in the north and
OL,15,Fwest. The wind however gradually
OL,16,Feasing overnight, with the clearest
OL,17,Fskies towards the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
