OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA risk of a few showers
OL,6,Fduring the morning, but much of Wales
OL,7,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells by the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Lighter winds than today
OL,9,Fwith temperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,12,Flargely dry and bright on Friday and
OL,13,FSaturday with temperatures also
OL,14,Fincreasing. A risk of some showers on
OL,15,FSunday but staying dry and warm for
OL,16,Fmost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
